@c CHAPTER: CLI
@node CLI
@chapter CLI

Guile Documentá comes with the @command{documenta} program, which
recognizes the following subcommands:


@deffn Command build source-path [destination-path]
Build the documentation of the library in @var{source-path} and place the
final result in @var{destination-path}.
@end deffn
